{
 "title": "Sunset pond v3",
 "notes": [
  "The sunset pond repainted with the phase 4 process: values first (grey shapes, snapshot \"values\"), then flat colour,",
  "then light and form, then detail at the duck, then the finish. The duck sits on the sun's path of broken glints, backlit,",
  "with a rim of light; the clouds are shapes lit from below; the far hills stay crisp and take their haze inside the silhouette;",
  "the lily pads are an olive mixed from the key. The loop drifts the clouds and water, bobs the duck and sways the reeds."
